E010 — Risk-Ranked Coordinator Worklist
QC passed at iteration 11, 2026-07-29.

Eleven iterations. 65 bug tasks beyond the 52 implementation tasks; all closed.
The final audit returned zero findings at ERROR or WARNING, with every published
figure re-derived from a command rather than from a prior report.

